WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
ReproLab checks AI generated Python repairs, using independent tests and a fresh sandbox for every execution.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The real Vultr inference service proposes a repair for this discount rounding bug.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
The original fails twelve cases. The candidate passes all twenty independent tests. The model does not decide acceptance.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
This actual execution used gVisor, no network, a read only root, a nonroot user, and resource limits.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Download the exact candidate and its evidence. The checks and source fingerprints travel with the repair.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Both actual sandbox containers were removed. If cleanup is unconfirmed, ReproLab cannot report a verified repair.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.875
This first version covers three Python fixtures. Recorded hashes bind the evidence, but do not attest the host.
